+# v1.4 Checkpoint — Stage 10
+
+## Completed v1.4 stages
+
+1. ArcGIS schema/domain audit — complete.
+2. UI specification — complete.
+3. AGOL multi-layer ingestion design — complete.
+4. POI Type symbology/config model — complete.
+5. v1.4 UI implementation — complete.
+6. Multi-layer export and attachment synchronization — complete and validated locally and in GitHub Actions.
+7. Multi-geometry rendering — complete.
+8. Unified POI Type + Geometry filtering — complete.
+9. Multi-geometry search + Detail Panel refinement — complete.
+10. Media/attachment regression and refinement — implemented in this checkpoint.
+
+## Authoritative ArcGIS source
+
+Public hosted view:
+
+`https://services5.arcgis.com/eJYUV73IZAY87Jwy/arcgis/rest/services/POI_Feature_Layer_view/FeatureServer`
+
+- `/0` Points
+- `/1` Lines
+- `/2` Polygons
+
+ArcGIS Online / Field Maps remains authoritative and is not modified by the website pipeline.
+
+## Current multi-geometry baseline
+
+The last validated live Stage 6 snapshot contained:
+
+- 1,198 Points
+- 6 Lines
+- 2 Polygons
+- 1,206 stable GlobalID-based entities total
+- 3 active datasets
+- 0 missing local attachments
+- 0 orphan local attachments
+
+The exact counts remain dynamic because the weekly GitHub Action refreshes ArcGIS data.
+
+## Stage 10 media contract
+
+- Images: local archive + browser thumbnails.
+- Audio: local archive + HTML5 audio playback.
+- Video: direct ArcGIS URL.
+- Other media: direct ArcGIS URL.
+- Structured `attachment_media` metadata is exported in addition to the existing `attachments` URL/path list.
+- Attachment metadata is generated for Points, Lines, and Polygons.
+- `layers-metadata.json` contains per-dataset media summaries.
+- Data QA verifies media metadata, storage semantics, local files, and one-to-one agreement with attachment references.
+
+## Next approved stage
+
+Stage 11 — Multi-dataset QA refinement, followed by standalone/embedded regression, documentation, and the v1.4.0 release sequence.
